      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.87,
      "end_seconds": 27.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "it's been going on for one week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.28,
      "end_seconds": 36.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.01,
      "end_seconds": 44.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "It, It It settles a little with leaning forward. It's on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.84,
      "end_seconds": 47.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.89,
      "end_seconds": 52.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get vomiting as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.59,
      "end_seconds": 57.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "okay did you get yellow eyes or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.69,
      "end_seconds": 63.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "no, uh, no yellow eyes or chest pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.69,
      "end_seconds": 65.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.48,
      "end_seconds": 69.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.33,
      "end_seconds": 76.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.27,
      "end_seconds": 81.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "that's normal as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.9,
      "end_seconds": 102.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "okay, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.61,
      "end_seconds": 106.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.14,
      "end_seconds": 118.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "okay, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.89,
      "end_seconds": 123.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "No nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.92,
      "end_seconds": 143.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.25,
      "end_seconds": 148.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.55,
      "end_seconds": 151.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.83,
      "end_seconds": 155.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.05,
      "end_seconds": 177.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Do you react to to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.07,
      "end_seconds": 180.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.5,
      "end_seconds": 187.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "right, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.03,
      "end_seconds": 192.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I take ibuprofen 400 milligrams when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.27,
      "end_seconds": 202.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Right, I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.72,
      "end_seconds": 211.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.49,
      "end_seconds": 235.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.9 degrees, heart rate 116. And saturation 96 percent, pressure 124 over 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.37,
      "end_seconds": 238.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "is that alright doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.62,
      "end_seconds": 242.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.52,
      "end_seconds": 250.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.91,
      "end_seconds": 254.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.6,
      "end_seconds": 272.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Your upper tummy is very tender and you look dehydrated."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.01,
      "end_seconds": 283.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "Right that's the examination finished. Having listened and examined it points towards acute pancreatitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.9,
      "end_seconds": 286.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.66,
      "end_seconds": 319.77,
      "duration_seconds": 31.11,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's acute pancreatitis, and we'll know more once the an abdominal scan is back. I'd like to arrange an abdominal scan for pancreatitis. You need admission for fluids and pain relief, nothing to eat for now. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. I think the surgical team should see you too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.67,
      "end_seconds": 324.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.59,
      "end_seconds": 338.36,
      "duration_seconds": 12.77,
      "text": "if the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. Book a review straight away. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.27,
      "end_seconds": 343.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.11,
      "end_seconds": 345.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
